- Conversion sizing, top of the 12% bracket, single/$30k/avg benefit:
  14,069 -> 16,069 of conversion (exactly +2,000, because the 85% SS cap has
  already bound by then so a converted dollar is a taxable dollar), taxBefore
  2,813 -> 2,573, taxAfter identical at 5,578 (both land on the same ceiling),
  cost per dollar 19.65c -> 18.70c.
- ss50/ss85 conversions do not move at all: provisional income is measured
